              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "calx, calcis — \"heel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Calx mea post longum iter dolet. My heel hurts after the long journey."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, third declension. Another calx means lime or chalk. English recalcitrant, kicking back, comes from this one."
            }
          ]
        },
